        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 Destroy All Letters: Space Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on an intergalactic journey where your reflexes and typing precision will decide the fate of your rocket! <strong>Destroy All Letters: Space Adventure</strong> is an arcade typing game that blends action, challenge, and skill in an electrifying rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your rocket by using your keyboard — every key you press makes the ship rise, while silence makes it fall. Your mission is simple yet intense: <strong>dodge dangerous numbers, stay afloat, and conquer space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct input gives you thrust and points; every mistake can be costly. Test your focus, speed, and coordination in an experience that challenges even the most agile players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique typing gameplay</strong> – Rise, dodge, and survive by typing with precision and rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong> – Face the endless mode for infinite challenge, or try the limited mode with defined objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance system</strong> – Track your time, hits, and mistakes in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> – Compare your score and prove you’re the best pilot-typist in the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb as high as you can, push your limits, and discover how far your typing skills can take you into space!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪐 Destroy All Letters: Space Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on an intergalactic journey where your reflexes and typing precision will decide the fate of your rocket! <strong>Destroy All Letters: Space Adventure</strong> is an arcade typing game that blends action, challenge, and skill in an electrifying rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your rocket by using your keyboard — every key you press makes the ship rise, while silence makes it fall. Your mission is simple yet intense: <strong>dodge dangerous numbers, stay afloat, and conquer space!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each correct input gives you thrust and points; every mistake can be costly. Test your focus, speed, and coordination in an experience that challenges even the most agile players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique typing gameplay</strong> – Rise, dodge, and survive by typing with precision and rhythm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two game modes</strong> – Face the endless mode for infinite challenge, or try the limited mode with defined objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance system</strong> – Track your time, hits, and mistakes in real time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboard</strong> – Compare your score and prove you’re the best pilot-typist in the universe.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb as high as you can, push your limits, and discover how far your typing skills can take you into space!</p>",
        "short_description": "A rocket, letters that decide your fate, and numbers trying to bring you down. Type fast, dodge the chaos, and see how far you can reach into space before your lives run out.",
